<title>THAILAND: Thai Wah pays 0.60 baht div for '96.</title>
<headline>Thai Wah pays 0.60 baht div for '96.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  0.60    vs    0.60</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 3, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	May 27, 1997</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Thai Wah Resorts Development Plc, a hotel operator.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
